    "name": "Drone Armada",
    "steam_appid": 3617510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth is under siege!</strong> Alien invaders darken our skies, and humanity\u2019s only hope is YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist as an elite pilot in Drone Armada, a high-octane blend of real-time action and deep strategy! You don\u2019t just command a few units \u2013 unleash and control <strong><u>huge swarms</u></strong> of customisable combat drones against overwhelming odds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/6bf24fcbb5ce10b7e9c9d1bf63ec3cb4.poster.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/6bf24fcbb5ce10b7e9c9d1bf63ec3cb4.webm?t=1749829387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your legion, research advanced technologies and upgrade your drones from nimble scouts to heavy assault platforms. Adapt your tactics on the fly to outsmart and crush the alien menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks, dominate the battlefield, and rise as the legendary Drone Commander who turned the tide - reclaiming Earth, one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/a2d1db9733c7c01fefa4320efe380620.poster.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/a2d1db9733c7c01fefa4320efe380620.webm?t=1749829387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Swarm Control</strong> - Take control of devastating drone swarms and turn chaos into precision. In Drone Armada, you don\u2019t micromanage \u2014 you command, adapt, and dominate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactics</strong> - Deploy your swarm into dynamic formations to suit any threat \u2014 tighten ranks for defence, spread wide for sweeping assaults, or surge forward in high-speed boosts. With on-the-fly abilities like shielding, targeting overrides, or energy surges, every encounter demands a fresh strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Play Styles</strong> - Whether you\u2019re overwhelming enemy lines with brute force or executing a surgical strike with high-speed scouts, victory comes down to how you command your swarm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/2d826eff2a0d7f9dc8e2feddf81a7005.poster.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/2d826eff2a0d7f9dc8e2feddf81a7005.webm?t=1749829387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Story Campaign</strong> - Progress through the full story with an exciting campaign packed with key missions, characters, and tactical turning points. Each region introduces new threats and environmental twists \u2014 forcing you to adapt your strategy with every deployment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Missions</strong> - Explore beyond the main path with optional objectives, unexpected allies, and hidden caches that offer rare upgrades and intel. These encounters shape your progress and unlock advanced tech.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Roguelite Mode</strong> - For the ultimate challenge, enter Roguelite Mode \u2014 a sprawling, high-risk endgame mission available at any time. Push deep into alien territory for powerful resources, but beware: only fully upgraded swarms stand a chance of surviving its escalating threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/1c633a1d11bbbcdb6dc5eb2673cb0f7b.poster.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/1c633a1d11bbbcdb6dc5eb2673cb0f7b.webm?t=1749829387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong> -\u00a0 As you progress, unlock a deep web of technologies, drone variants, and command centre upgrades that permanently expand your strategic options. Specialise your forces with enhanced sensors, energy shielding, high-output weaponry, and more \u2014 every unlock changes how you fight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Driven Upgrades</strong> - Gather  resources and intel  from missions, side objectives, and elite enemies to push your tech tree forward. Upgrade both your drones and your overall command infrastructure to gain new battlefield abilities and advanced load-outs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Unstoppable -</strong> Each mission you complete increases your power \u2014 and  builds toward your ultimate victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/77df850a36f7d0f39255cd8028408d52.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 /></span></p>",
