<strong>Full Story Campaign</strong> - Progress through the full story with an exciting campaign packed with key missions, characters, and tactical turning points. Each region introduces new threats and environmental twists \u2014 forcing you to adapt your strategy with every deployment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Missions</strong> - Explore beyond the main path with optional objectives, unexpected allies, and hidden caches that offer rare upgrades and intel. These encounters shape your progress and unlock advanced tech.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Roguelite Mode</strong> - For the ultimate challenge, enter Roguelite Mode \u2014 a sprawling, high-risk endgame mission available at any time. Push deep into alien territory for powerful resources, but beware: only fully upgraded swarms stand a chance of surviving its escalating threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/1c633a1d11bbbcdb6dc5eb2673cb0f7b.poster.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/1c633a1d11bbbcdb6dc5eb2673cb0f7b.webm?t=1749829387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong> -\u00a0 As you progress, unlock a deep web of technologies, drone variants, and command centre upgrades that permanently expand your strategic options. Specialise your forces with enhanced sensors, energy shielding, high-output weaponry, and more \u2014 every unlock changes how you fight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Driven Upgrades</strong> - Gather  resources and intel  from missions, side objectives, and elite enemies to push your tech tree forward. Upgrade both your drones and your overall command infrastructure to gain new battlefield abilities and advanced load-outs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Unstoppable -</strong> Each mission you complete increases your power \u2014 and  builds toward your ultimate victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/77df850a36f7d0f39255cd8028408d52.avif?t=1749829387\" width=616 height=276 /></span></p>",
